    "detailed_description": "This is a short (~30 minutes) first-person psychological horror game set in a deep, dark cave.<br><br>Cave exploring is a common practice. But what happens when you overstep your boundaries? The suffocating jaws of a tight cave don't let go as easily as they grab hold of you. Deployed as part of a rescue effort, you must explore the depths of Deep Den Cave and discover what happened to the last explorer that ventured down its path. Don't get lost.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A beautiful hand-crafted cave environment to navigate.<br></li><li> First-person caving mechanics. You'll need to repel down ropes, throw flares, and crawl your way through the game.<br></li><li> Scary events and suspenseful moments.<br></li><li> 4 (?) Analog horror tapes to discover. <br></li><li> A disturbing mystery for you to unravel.</li></ul>",
